### 5. Distributed & Streaming Tests

#### [NEW] [test_distributed.py](file:///c:/Users/PC/Desktop/vlm-image-loader/tests/test_distributed.py)

Pytest-based unit tests covering:

**Shard Manifest tests:**
- `test_manifest_round_trip` — build → save → load → compare
- `test_assign_shards_deterministic` — same inputs always produce same output
- `test_assign_shards_full_coverage` — union of all ranks' shards equals the full set
- `test_assign_shards_no_overlap` — no shard assigned to two ranks
- `test_assign_shards_edge_cases` — world_size > num_shards, world_size == 1, etc.

**Streaming pipeline tests:**
- `test_streaming_pipeline_produces_shards` — verify shards are written correctly
- `test_streaming_pipeline_memory_bounded` — verify that peak memory stays bounded (not O(N) on dataset size)
- `test_multiprocessing_correctness` — verify that multiprocessing produces identical output to single-threaded

